<title>HONG KONG: Furama Hotel interim net up 9.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Furama Hotel interim net up 9.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   50.6   vs  47.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    23.0   vs  23.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    102.81 vs  93.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		     364.17 vs  329.47</p>
<p>    Company name		 Furama Hotel Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 4-12, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 3, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Furama Hotel is a hotel operator and owner.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
